# Server-only secrets for the "Ask George" RAG assistant (never exposed to the client).
# Local full-stack dev: `vercel dev`. Production: set these in Vercel Project Settings → Environment Variables.

# OpenAI — used ONLY for embeddings (text-embedding-3-small), for `pnpm embed` and per-query retrieval.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Groq — answer generation (llama-3.3-70b-versatile), free tier.
GROQ_API_KEY=
